  "prefLabel": "Occ 102.03 National Board for Certification in Occupational Therapy (NBCOT)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 102.03 “National Board for Certification in Occupational Therapy (NBCOT)” means the entity that develops the national examination for occupational therapy and certifies individuals in occupational therapy practice or its successor.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 1-26-05; ss by #13081, eff 7-31-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 100); ss by #14366, eff 9-9-25",
